TI  - Temperature Effects on the Virulence and Horizontal Transmission of &lt;i&gt;Beauveria bassiana&lt;/i&gt; Against &lt;i&gt;Zeugodacus cucurbitae&lt;/i&gt; with SIR Model Analysis
