TI  - Infection of the Stable Fly, <i>Stomoxys calcitrans</i>, L. 1758 (Diptera: Muscidae) by the Entomopathogenic Fungi <i>Metarhizium anisopliae</i> (Hypocreales: Clavicipitaceae) Negatively Affects Its Survival, Feeding Propensity, Fecundity, Fertility, and Fitness Parameters
